<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Warner-Lambert EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Warner-Lambert EPS view raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch raised its earnings estimates on Warner-Lambert Co to $3.25 a share from $3.20 a share for 1997 and to $4.35 a share from $4.10 a share for 1998, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
